  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is increasing&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p>Differentiate&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>14</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
